  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/s449/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"410\" data-original-width=\"449\" height=\"183\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" width=\"200\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא יִתְיַצֵּב אִישׁ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּפָנֶיךָ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְעָמְדוּ זָרִים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְרָעוּ צֹאנְךָ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּמִדְרָךְ כַּף רַגְלְךָ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לְךָ יִהְיֶה וּלְזַרְעֲךָ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אִם שָׁמוֹעַ תִּשְׁמַע,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּקוֹל אֱלֹהֶיךָ</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span data-end=\"220\" data-start=\"208\">אֱמוּנָה</span>&nbsp;-<br data-end=\"225\" data-start=\"222\" />זֶה לִפְסוֹעַ בְּשְׁבִיל רֵיק,<br data-end=\"258\" data-start=\"255\" />כִּי אַתָּה בּוֹטֵחַ שֶׁהָאֲדָמָה&nbsp;תָּבוֹא לִקְרָאתְךָ...</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שְׂכַר מִצְוָה - מִצְוָה נוֹסֶפֶת</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שְׂכַר עֲבֵרָה - הַקֹּשִׁי לָצֵאת מִמֶּנָּה</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"לֹא יִתְיַצֵּב אִישׁ&nbsp;<span data-end=\"139\" data-start=\"124\">בִּפְנֵיכֶם</span>\" =&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">1056 = \"</span><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-family: arial; text-align: -webkit-center;\">הַיּוֹם אִם בְּקֹלוֹ תִשְׁמָעוּ\" (תהילים צ\"ה ז)</span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-family: arial; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><br /></span></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-family: arial; text-align: -webkit-center;\"></span></p><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'</span><b style=\"color: black;\">עֵקֶב</b><span style=\"color: #626262;\">' / '<span style=\"background-color: white; color: black;\">חֲלָף</span>'<br /></span></span>❖<span style=\"background-color: white;\">תמורה - החלפה</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'<b style=\"color: black;\">מוֹקֵשׁ</b>' / '</span><span style=\"background-color: white; color: black;\">תַקְלָא</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'<br /></span></span>❖<span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;מכשול - תקלה.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'</span><b style=\"color: black;\">וְהַנִּסְתָּרִים</b><span style=\"color: #626262;\">' / '</span><span style=\"background-color: white; color: black;\">וּדְאִטְּמַרוּ</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'<br /></span></span>❖<span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;נעלמים - טמירים.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'</span><b style=\"color: black;\">מְעַט</b><span style=\"color: #626262;\">' / '</span><span style=\"background-color: white; color: black;\">זְעֵיר</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'<br /></span></span>❖<span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;מעט, קצת, קטן - זעיר</span>.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'</span><b style=\"color: black;\">תַּחְצֹב</b><span style=\"color: #626262;\">' / '</span><span style=\"background-color: white; color: black;\">תִּפְסוּל</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'<br /></span></span>❖<span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;חטיבה, ביקוע - פיסול.</span></span></li></ol><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">👁️ מבט חד<br /></h2><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"וְגַם אֶת הַצִּרְעָה יְשַׁלַּח ה' אֱלֹהֶיךָ בָּם\"</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiYtyg9eDVaheRViB3gkafv1uHFc5RhZBMPGmAy2ahXnO2tElGvX8Zz-qzdyLSjYHRdS4S61vR50vWgia-YTPVRpARbdDUo96ubUPyoBgkuur-wcKgZdqf5mPqhYyTPIt7nEKzVLnGpo_zbVKkaDAtWGk_vIIHjUNzcZJj_I-BcueC2aZyXn17LhhyphenhyphenRmUE/s1024/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jul%2028,%202025,%2002_31_28%20PM.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"153\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiYtyg9eDVaheRViB3gkafv1uHFc5RhZBMPGmAy2ahXnO2tElGvX8Zz-qzdyLSjYHRdS4S61vR50vWgia-YTPVRpARbdDUo96ubUPyoBgkuur-wcKgZdqf5mPqhYyTPIt7nEKzVLnGpo_zbVKkaDAtWGk_vIIHjUNzcZJj_I-BcueC2aZyXn17LhhyphenhyphenRmUE/w153-h153/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jul%2028,%202025,%2002_31_28%20PM.png\" width=\"153\" /></a></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\">כטב\"ם - כלי טבעי בלתי מאוייש</div></span></div></span></div></span></div></div>"
}
